==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|Scotland}}, {{m|enm|Scotlond}}, from {{inh|en|ang|Scotland|t=Ireland", later also "Scotland|lit=land of the Scots}}, equivalent to {{af|en|Scot|-land}}. Compare {{cog|fy|Skotlân|t=Scotland}}, {{cog|nl|Schotland|t=Scotland}}, {{cog|de|Schottland|t=Scotland}}, {{cog|da|Skotland|t=Scotland}}, {{cog|is|Skotland|t=Scotland}}.

